{
  "title": "Lovely Spicy Brazilian Chicken Wrap",
  "description": "A spicy and romantic Brazilian dish featuring dried mint and leaf wrap steam, this satvik friendly meal is perfect for a special occasion. The combination of chewy chicken and crunchy vegetables makes for a delightful texture.",
  "cuisine": "Brazilian",
  "diet": [
